  "description": "CodeBrix.YamlParse is a fully managed .NET library for YAML, ported from YamlDotNet 18.1.0. It provides low-level parsing and emitting of YAML, a high-level representation model similar to XmlDocument, and a serialization library that reads and writes objects from and to YAML streams. Targets .NET 10 with no dependencies other than .NET.",
